resources.string:
[Cloudflare Tunnel troubleshooting]
1. Log in to the VPS and check the OpenCode process is running (e.g. `pgrep opencode` or `opencode serve`);
2. Make sure the cloudflared config service port exactly matches the OpenCode port (default 4096);
3. Confirm no firewall on the VPS blocks the 127.0.0.1 port.

[SakuraFrp troubleshooting]
1. Check that the SakuraFrp client/node is online and the tunnel is enabled;
2. Confirm the tunnel's target intranet port matches the OpenCode service port;
3. If using mainland China nodes on HTTP ports 80/443, make sure the domain has completed ICP filing, otherwise it will be blocked.

[DNS troubleshooting]
1. Check the domain spelling;
2. Confirm the domain's DNS records have taken effect;
3. Switch the phone's current network (Wi-Fi/mobile data) and retry.
